The NONOS Linux tour: Linux programs on a capability microkernel, each one
proved by its STARK trailer and publisher signature before any page of it
runs. From the Terminal:

  linux python3 /usr/share/nonos/tour/mandelbrot.py
      the Mandelbrot set in 24-bit colour, two pixels to a character cell
  linux python3
      CPython 3.12, its standard library from /usr/lib/python312.zip
  linux lua -e "print(_VERSION)"
  linux zstd -b1
      Zstandard's own benchmark
  linux sh
      a BusyBox shell; ls, vi, awk, grep, tar, wget and 300 more are there
  linux john --test=0
      John the Ripper's self-test; `linux john --wordlist=/usr/share/john/password.lst
      HASHFILE` audits a password hash file. NONOS's own security toolset.
  qwen
      Qwen on this machine, once a tier is installed (qwen tiers, qwen get)
